---
/** Terms of service — short, honest, cafe-scale. */
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Badge from '../components/ui/Badge.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Belluno Cafe, Vesu Surat"
  description="House rules for dining, takeaway and using the Belluno website. Vesu, Surat."
>
  <main id="main" class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-10 pb-20">
    <Badge>Legal</Badge>
    <h1 class="font-serif font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-4xl sm:text-6xl mt-3">Terms of service.</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-3">Last updated September 2026.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-2xl text-ink">The short version</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Be kind to staff and fellow guests, and the rooftop stays lovely for everyone. Prices on the menu board rule at the counter; online trays are a convenience, not a contract.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-2xl text-ink">Orders and payment</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Dine-in and takeaway only — we do not deliver. Payment happens at the counter. GST applies as shown at checkout. If a dish runs out, we will suggest the closest alternative or take it off your bill.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-2xl text-ink">Reservations</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Tables are held for 15 minutes past the agreed time on busy evenings. Groups above six should book a day ahead on <a class="underline underline-offset-4 font-semibold text-ink" href="tel:09274073791">092740 73791</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif font-medium text-2xl text-ink">The website</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Menu, hours and photos are kept fresh but the board at the cafe wins on the day. Do not misuse the forms — spam and abuse get blocked.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
